  "title": "哥伦 - 金迪奥 景秀庄园 瑰夏 厌氧日晒/酒花蜜处理 - 白色花香、橙子、葡萄柚、树莓、樱桃 / 洋甘菊、香茅、油桃、番石榴",
  "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SYiavWqL3_tBN42J-erD8Q",
  "publish_time": 1716216718,
  "status": "body_recovered",
  "extraction_method": "article_dom",
  "body_text": "基本资料\n生产者：\nEdwin Noreña\n庄园： 景秀庄园\nCampo Hermoso\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n海拔高度：1800 - 1850 米 masl\n产区：金迪奥\n‍\n品种：瑰夏 Gesha\n采收处理：2023 Q4\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n海运到港：2024.4月\n‍\n‍\n‍\n烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n处理方式：厌氧日晒 Anaerobic Natural\n风味：白色花香、橙子、葡萄柚、树莓、樱桃、深色葡萄\nWhite floral, Orange, Grapefruit,Raspberry, Cherry‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍, Dark grape\n这款厌氧日晒的瑰夏入口复合的白色花香和轻微的草本植物香气，然后转橙子和葡萄柚的果香果酸，中段还会有树莓樱桃浮现出来，中温会有深色葡萄甚至葡萄皮的感觉，酸度中高，甜感非常饱满，整体喝起来酸甜是酸转甜，会有生津回甘的感觉,中低温很舒适～\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n处理方式：酒花厌氧蜜处理 IPA Anaerobic Honey ‍‍\n风味：洋甘菊、香茅、油桃、橙子、番石榴\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\nChamomile, Lemongrass, Nectarine, Orange, Guava\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n入口非常浓郁的类似洋甘菊，杭白菊、香茅的复合香气，紧跟着有类似脐橙/沃柑，复合红心柚子的酸甜；酸甜和触感都非常的饱满；而且温度下来更好喝，更饱满～\n图片来源：CAFE IMPORTS，Quindio浅绿色位于中部\n关于养豆、储存与冲煮\n关于景秀\nCampo Hermoso处于哥伦比亚中部，海拔1800-1850米，土壤中含有大量的火山物质和高海拔，给咖啡树提供了浓郁风味物质和出色的甜味；\n‍\n‍\nEdwin已经在咖啡生产领域工作了20多年，在Campo Hermoso「景秀庄园」种植Heirloom原生种、Cenicafe 1、Gesha瑰夏、Yellow Bourbon黄波旁和Red Bourbon红波旁。为了生产优质咖啡，他凭着自己对咖啡发酵方面的深厚经验，利用咖啡樱桃在处理中自身产生的粘液创新加工方式—Mossto处理。\nEdwin非常兴奋，因为他用这样全新的加工方式，发挥出了瑰夏品种强烈而杰出的味道：新鲜，水果，花香，充满活力的高品质高酸质和足够的甜感，优雅而顺滑。\n关于本批次（厌氧日晒）处理方式：\n采摘红果，浮选去除瑕疵果和异物等；\n筛选后的咖啡红果放入发酵桶，静置厌氧发酵292小时\n加入发酵液发酵48小时\n晒床缓慢晾晒干燥\n到达目标含水率后收入麻袋中，放置在仓库中静置1个月\n关于酒花厌氧蜜处理过程：\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n采摘红果，Brix大于18%，浮选\n筛选后的红果放入发酵罐，静置厌氧发酵72小时\n收集发酵产生的发酵液mosto\n脱皮，最大程度的保留果胶，同时脱皮产生的汁水（果皮果胶粘液）也收集起来；用这部分汁水与研碎的酒花还有酿酒酵母菌混合一起\n将脱皮后的咖啡豆（带着果胶）浸泡在混合后的发酵液中静置发酵（目前还没有发酵时长信息）\n晾晒\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          基本资料\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          生产者：\n          <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           Edwin Noreña\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园： 景秀庄园\n          <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           Campo Hermoso\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          海拔高度：1800 - 1850 米 masl\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          产区：金迪奥\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：瑰夏 Gesha\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          采收处理：2023 Q4\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          海运到港：2024.4月\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n           烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：厌氧日晒 Anaerobic Natural\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：白色花香、橙子、葡萄柚、树莓、樱桃、深色葡萄\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          White floral, Orange, Grapefruit,Raspberry, Cherry‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍, Dark grape\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这款厌氧日晒的瑰夏入口复合的白色花香和轻微的草本植物香气，然后转橙子和葡萄柚的果香果酸，中段还会有树莓樱桃浮现出来，中温会有深色葡萄甚至葡萄皮的感觉，酸度中高，甜感非常饱满，整体喝起来酸甜是酸转甜，会有生津回甘的感觉,中低温很舒适～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：酒花厌氧蜜处理 IPA Anaerobic Honey ‍‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：洋甘菊、香茅、油桃、橙子、番石榴\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Chamomile, Lemongrass, Nectarine, Orange, Guava\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-indent: 0em;\">\n          入口非常浓郁的类似洋甘菊，杭白菊、香茅的复合香气，紧跟着有类似脐橙/沃柑，复合红心柚子的酸甜；酸甜和触感都非常的饱满；而且温度下来更好喝，更饱满～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TAWWsbN3mr1FLZttGiavtib4yTF4pjQYW9PP6RnwcvH1mibJmJicBoSGVdyDibqR46cJ9NjN0Rq3Cflmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          图片来源：CAFE IMPORTS，Quindio浅绿色位于中部\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于养豆、储存与冲煮\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于景秀\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n          Campo Hermoso处于哥伦比亚中部，海拔1800-1850米，土壤中含有大量的火山物质和高海拔，给咖啡树提供了浓郁风味物质和出色的甜味；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SsIHOhunNPvbNdyEmluJnQXaETYhfIK2XzpR6vwpb7pxZFib22BmTkicPIa5oKbaT4iarKNJgJYFj5Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          Edwin已经在咖啡生产领域工作了20多年，在Campo Hermoso「景秀庄园」种植Heirloom原生种、Cenicafe 1、Gesha瑰夏、Yellow Bourbon黄波旁和Red Bourbon红波旁。为了生产优质咖啡，他凭着自己对咖啡发酵方面的深厚经验，利用咖啡樱桃在处理中自身产生的粘液创新加工方式—Mossto处理。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SsIHOhunNPvbNdyEmluJnQTPfibiaWQN3glElC0TLics7VHcvEUe4FacP25HfQicCCmyicOZ7wd9eNBBg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          Edwin非常兴奋，因为他用这样全新的加工方式，发挥出了瑰夏品种强烈而杰出的味道：新鲜，水果，花香，充满活力的高品质高酸质和足够的甜感，优雅而顺滑。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SsIHOhunNPvbNdyEmluJnQWj2K6ogeZlDwktOiacR2dmibsBABtuQRWLodRcS3ABlyvdObMC7PWviaA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          关于本批次（厌氧日晒）处理方式：\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            采摘红果，浮选去除瑕疵果和异物等；\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            筛选后的咖啡红果放入发酵桶，静置厌氧发酵292小时\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            加入发酵液发酵48小时\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            晒床缓慢晾晒干燥\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            到达目标含水率后收入麻袋中，放置在仓库中静置1个月\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SsIHOhunNPvbNdyEmluJnQTPfibiaWQN3glElC0TLics7VHcvEUe4FacP25HfQicCCmyicOZ7wd9eNBBg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          关于酒花厌氧蜜处理过程：\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            采摘红果，Brix大于18%，浮选\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            筛选后的红果放入发酵罐，静置厌氧发酵72小时\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            收集发酵产生的发酵液mosto\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            脱皮，最大程度的保留果胶，同时脱皮产生的汁水（果皮果胶粘液）也收集起来；用这部分汁水与研碎的酒花还有酿酒酵母菌混合一起\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            将脱皮后的咖啡豆（带着果胶）浸泡在混合后的发酵液中静置发酵（目前还没有发酵时长信息）\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            晾晒\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7StU52x4JyZiakAYzCTibTMXT4x3jnZxym54jEfXohgkDiaTia3ia8QG4tIMWrB3D5c4y7Abn80uxbdPQA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
